OL,15,G2355 Loop: The Art of Paper Sculpting
OL,16,     FCharles Young takes inspiration
OL,17,     Ffrom the buildings of Edinburgh
OL,18,     Fand painstakingly transforms one
OL,19,     Fof Scotland's most famous and
OL,20,     Fcomplex edifices into a tiny,
OL,21,     Fthree-dimensional structure.
